        "content": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>I'm happy to share i have written a Redis Client for Lean4. It's not using FFI, everything is Lean native, leveraging on top of Lean TCP Async stack.<br>\nOnce TLS bindings from <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"481858\">@Sofia Rodrigues</span> is merged i'll add support for it.<br>\nAfter that i'll add support for Clusters (mainly handling redirection answers)<br>\nA quick exemple code on how to use it :</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LeanRedis</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LeanRedis</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Internal</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Async</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">client</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Client</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">newDefault</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">endpoint</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">host</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"127.0.0.1\"</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">port</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">6379</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">client</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">connect</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">client</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"greeting\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"hello\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">client</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"greeting\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- output : some \"hello\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|&gt;.</span><span class=\"n\">block</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Link to project : <a href=\"https://github.com/ecyrbe/lean-redis\">https://github.com/ecyrbe/lean-redis</a></p>",
        "id": 598520277,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
